{%- comment -%}
  V3 · Huecos de la galería de la ficha mientras no haya fotos con derechos.
  Lista visible (plegable para no empujar la CTA fuera de la primera pantalla) de las
  tomas necesarias (docs/V3_PLAN_DE_ACTIVOS.md). Cada hueco es un marcador ⟦PENDING⟧
  detectable por prelaunch-check; nunca una foto simulada.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign shots = 'Side view|In the hand (to show size)|Fit adjustment detail|Material close-up|Case and packaging|Real use (authorized)|Lifestyle: adult couple at night' | split: '|' -%}
<div class="ds-gallery-slots">
  {%- render 'ds-photo-placeholder', label: 'Front view of the real product on a neutral background' -%}
  <details class="ds-gallery-slots__more">
    <summary>{{ 'ds.photo.needed' | t }} ({{ shots.size | plus: 1 }})</summary>
    <ul class="ds-gallery-slots__list" role="list">
      {%- for s in shots -%}
        <li class="ds-gallery-slots__item" data-ds-placeholder><span>⟦{{ 'ds.photo.short' | t }}⟧</span> {{ s }}</li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </details>
</div>
